All 8 tests pass — both the new cases and existing behavior are preserved.

**Bug:** The original implementation split on spaces and checked `hasPrefix("#")`. This missed tags adjacent to punctuation like `,#urgent` (the comma is part of the token, so it doesn't start with `#`) and `(#ideas)` (the paren is part of the token).

**Fix:** Replaced the space-split approach with an `NSRegularExpression` matching `#[a-zA-Z0-9_]+` anywhere in the string. This correctly extracts tags regardless of surrounding punctuation, returns them in order of appearance, and preserves all existing behavior.


